OL,3,GNEWSALaughter and learning at BBC
OL,4,AChildren in Need-backed homework club
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a community hall in east Belfast,
OL,7,Fchatter and laughter fills the air as
OL,8,Fchildren play pool, draw cartoons and
OL,9,Ffinish schoolwork with friends.
OL,11,FThis is Ledley Hall Boys and Girls
OL,12,FClub, which runs an after-school
OL,13,Fhomework group with the help of BBC
OL,14,FChildren in Need.
OL,16,F"It's a safe space for them," says
OL,17,FCaitlin McAlinden.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
